        "counterexample": "Raw 'Yes, speaking. Are you a robot?' with event k=yes|c=1 plus k=question|c=1|q=ai. The split only matches comma/semicolon, so the reply stays whole and fails exact-set matching. recipient_asks increments and a third such turn closes not_reached/unclear, even though identity was confirmed.",
