        "title": "Unfinished consent withdrawal (c=0) does not block a sibling confirm",
        "source_reference": "controller.py descriptive_pause=any(c=='1' for consent_rows); consent rows dropped; confirm branch gated only by raw consent_blocked/permission_pause",
        "counterexample": "In confirm phase, event k=consent|c=0|v=withdraw plus k=confirm|c=1|p=all, with raw 'hold on, I am not sure yes I confirm'. 'hold on' is not in either the blocked or pause regex. If raw omits 'not' (model-extracted, untrusted), consent becomes readback and create_promise is dispatched despite a pending withdrawal.",
